[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0701","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0701.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0971","title":"Avirt Mail 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Avirt Mail 4.0 和 4.2 版本在处理 SMTP 协议的 \"RCPT TO\" 和 \"MAIL FROM\" 命令时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标邮件服务器发送超长的邮件地址参数，触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务崩溃（拒绝服务），并可能进一步利用该漏洞执行任意代码。该漏洞 CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级为严重，影响所有运行 Avirt Mail 4.0 及 4.2 的系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0971"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:53Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Avirt Mail 4.3 或更高版本，该版本已修复对 SMTP 命令输入长度的校验。如厂商已停止维护，建议迁移至其他受支持的邮件服务器软件（如 Postfix、Exim）。临时缓解措施：在 SMTP 代理或防火墙层面限制 MAIL FROM 和 RCPT TO 命令参数长度不超过 256 字符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0301.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5397","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5398","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20311","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0971.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0971.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0971","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0971.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0971.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f9ec51bb42a17e0dd0492f440cee3d253cc8275e/2000/CVE-2000-0971.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0971.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0971.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0971.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0971.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0701.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0698","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0698.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0967","title":"PHP 3.0/4.0 错误日志格式字符串注入远程代码执行漏洞","description":"PHP 3.0.16 及 4.0.2 版本中存在格式化字符串漏洞，由于 PHP 未能正确过滤用户注入的格式化字符串参数，当触发特定错误时，格式化字符串内容会被错误地写入错误日志，远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求触发该漏洞，利用格式化字符串写入特性实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 PHP 3.x 及 4.x 系列版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0967"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:52Z","remediation":"升级 PHP 至修复版本：PHP 4.0.2 升级到 4.0.3pl1 及以上，PHP 3.x 升级到 3.0.18 及以上。各发行版补丁：Red Hat 参考 RHSA-2000:088/RHSA-2000:095，Caldera 参考 CSSA-2000-037.0，Mandrake 参考 MDKSA-2000:062，FreeBSD 参考 FreeBSD-SA-00:75。临时缓解措施：关闭 display_errors，禁止用户输入写入 error_log，以最小权限运行 PHP 进程。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0204.html","http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/a101200-1.txt","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-037.0.txt","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-062.php3?dis=7.1","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-088.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-095.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1786","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5359","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20286","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0967.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0967","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0967.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0967.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bd9fe5c6ad63a26e0384af877431750bd67b40cc/2000/CVE-2000-0967.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0967.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0967.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0967.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0967.json","https://github.com/psecio/versionscan/blob/81cee8accd05924b8421db9ed2a867047819d15a/CONTRIBUTING.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0698.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0698.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0698.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0697","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0697.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0958","title":"Sun HotJava Browser 任意DOM访问漏洞","description":"Sun HotJava Browser 3.0 存在任意 DOM 访问漏洞。远程攻击者可通过在命名窗口中打开特制的 javascript: URL，绕过浏览器的同源策略限制，跨域访问目标网页的文档对象模型（DOM），导致敏感信息泄露。攻击无需身份认证，仅需诱使用户访问恶意链接即可触发。该漏洞影响 HotJava Browser 3.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0958"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:51Z","remediation":"Sun HotJava Browser 已停止维护多年，官方未发布补丁。建议立即停止使用 HotJava Browser，改用现代受支持的浏览器（如 Firefox、Chrome、Edge），并启用 JavaScript 安全策略，限制跨窗口 DOM 访问权限。如必须使用，可在浏览器中禁用 JavaScript 功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0349.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5428","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20322","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0958.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0958.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0958","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0958.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0958.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0958.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/debb5b9043b725433d6b6e41048f63a9bcce2f7e/2000/CVE-2000-0958.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0958.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0958.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0958.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0697.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0697.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0697.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0694","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0694.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0953","title":"Evolvable Shambala Server 4.5 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Shambala Server 4.5 存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过建立 TCP 连接后立即关闭该连接，导致服务器处理异常连接状态时资源耗尽或进程崩溃，造成服务不可用。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证即可远程触发，影响服务器正常运行。目前已有公开 PoC 利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0953"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:50Z","remediation":"Shambala Server 4.5 已停止维护，官方不再提供补丁。建议立即停止使用该版本，迁移至受支持的替代产品（如 Apache HTTP Server 或 Nginx）。如无法立即替换，可在网络防火墙或主机层面配置规则，仅允许可信 IP 访问 Shambala 服务端口，并部署入侵检测系统监控异常连接行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0134.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1778","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5345","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20282","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ca27d016571e65b8b794044c0722f4842d8c02cb/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0953.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be58e0e3c542843372e0883fccedcf7e869f2994/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0953.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0953","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0953.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0953.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0953.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7f050e8fca5626f412366605b1f58958789b2919/2000/CVE-2000-0953.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0953.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0953.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0953.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0694.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0693","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0693.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0951","title":"Microsoft IIS 5.0 索引目录泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 5.0 在启用 Index Server 且设置 Index 属性的情况下存在配置错误漏洞。远程攻击者可通过 WebDAV 搜索功能向目标服务器发送特制请求，利用该配置缺陷枚举 Web 根目录下的文件目录结构，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低，仅需网络访问即可实施。该漏洞影响 Microsoft IIS 5.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0951"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:50Z","remediation":"升级到受支持的 Windows Server 版本（如 2008 以上），或卸载 Indexing Service 组件；在 IIS 管理器中取消网站目录的\"索引此资源\"属性；禁用 WebDAV 扩展（删除 WebDAV 映射或通过 URLScan 过滤 HTTP 的 SEARCH/PROPFIND 方法）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/a100400-1.txt","http://www.microsoft.com/technet/support/kb.asp?ID=272079","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1756","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5335","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20269","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c6e3b04088d3a34fb448e0c7ffd377395dcc3ef8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0951.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0951.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0951","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0951.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/2c866c27fe697535dca864b0ffb9170252ab9537/references/CVE-2000-0951-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0951.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7f050e8fca5626f412366605b1f58958789b2919/2000/CVE-2000-0951.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0951.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0951.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0951.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0693.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0693.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0693.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0691","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0691.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0945","title":"Cisco Catalyst 3500 XL 任意命令执行漏洞","description":"Cisco Catalyst 3500 XL 系列交换机的 Web 配置接口存在未授权命令执行漏洞。当设备未设置 enable 密码时，远程攻击者无需任何身份认证，只需向目标交换机的 Web 管理界面发送包含 /exec/ 目录的特制 URL 请求，即可在设备上以最高权限执行任意系统命令。攻击者可利用该漏洞完全控制受影响交换机，进而窃取网络流量、修改配置或发起进一步内网攻击。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，影响所有未设置 enable 密码的 Catalyst 3500 XL 交换机。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0945"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:49Z","remediation":"立即为 Catalyst 3500 XL 交换机配置 enable 密码（全局配置模式下执行 `enable secret <密码>`），防止未授权访问 /exec/ 目录。如无需 Web 管理功能，建议在全局配置模式下使用 `no ip http server` 关闭 HTTP 服务；若必须保留，应使用 `ip http access-class <ACL编号>` 限制仅允许管理网段 IP 访问，并在接口上配置 ACL 过滤对 80 端口的非授权访问。该设备已停止支持，建议尽快迁移至受支持的 Cisco 交换机型号。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0380.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0194.html","http://www.osvdb.org/444","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1846","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5415","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20330","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0945.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0945.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0945","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0945.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0945.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3355d48a7d0ca0d3b4124274995f7205f0bb89f2/2000/CVE-2000-0945.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0945.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0945.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/7b0091a6728c321d97febad01bf502be7a113020/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0945.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0691.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0691.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0691.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0690","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0690.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0944","title":"CGI Script Center News Update 管理员密码修改漏洞","description":"CGI Script Center News Update 1.1 在管理员密码修改功能中存在身份验证绕过漏洞。该软件未对原始管理员密码进行有效验证，导致远程攻击者无需知道当前密码即可直接修改管理员密码。攻击者只需向目标系统发送特制的密码修改请求，即可完全接管系统管理权限。该漏洞影响范围广泛，利用门槛极低，无需任何身份认证即可远程触发，危害严重。ExploitDB 已公开该漏洞的利用代码（ID: 179）。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0944"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:49Z","remediation":"立即停止使用 CGI Script Center News Update 1.1，替换为受支持的内容管理系统（如 WordPress、Drupal 等）。如无法立即替换，在 Web 服务器（Apache）中通过 .htaccess 或 httpd.conf 对 /cgi-bin/newsup.pl 路径添加 IP 白名单和 HTTP 基本认证，限制仅授权管理员可访问密码修改功能；同时移除 newsup.pl 的 setuid/setgid 权限，确保 CGI 目录权限为 755 且属主为非 root 用户。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0402.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1881","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5433","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/179","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0944.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0944.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0944","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0944.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0944.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3355d48a7d0ca0d3b4124274995f7205f0bb89f2/2000/CVE-2000-0944.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0944.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0944.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0944.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0944.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0690.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0690.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0690.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0689","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0689.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0942","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 Indexing Services 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Microsoft Indexing Services for Windows 2000 中的 CiWebHitsFile 组件存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向运行 IIS 4/5 的目标服务器发送特制的 .htw 请求，在 CiRestriction 参数中注入恶意脚本代码，当用户访问受影响的索引页面时脚本将在用户浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击复杂度较高，影响 Windows 2000 及早期 IIS 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0942"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:49Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-098（后由 MS01-025 取代）提供的补丁，该补丁移除了 Indexing Service 中 ActiveX 控件的\"safe for scripting\"标记。下载地址：https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=C93BC4EB-ED43-4887-80AA-9E3C2B053430。如无法安装补丁，可在 Internet Explorer 中禁用 ActiveX 控件或通过防火墙阻止对 .htw 文件的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/141903","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1861","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-084","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5441","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20335","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2000/CVE-2000-0942.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0942.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0942.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0942","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0942.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0942.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0942.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/abb3d9c240bc75ee9d5885882897d780d10d15cb/2000/CVE-2000-0942.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0942.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0942.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0689.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0689.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0689.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0687","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0687.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0941","title":"Kootenay Web Inc KW Whois 1.0 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Kootenay Web KW Whois 1.0 CGI 程序存在远程命令执行漏洞，由于程序未对用户输入的 \"whois\" 参数进行有效过滤，远程攻击者可通过在参数中注入 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符等）执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 Kootenay Web KW Whois 1.0 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，获取服务器完全控制权。目前已存在公开的 Exploit-DB 利用代码。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0941"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:49Z","remediation":"立即删除或禁用 KW Whois 1.0 CGI 脚本（通常位于 cgi-bin/whois 目录下），该产品已停止维护且无官方补丁。如业务必须使用，需在 CGI 脚本入口处对 whois 参数进行严格过滤，禁止传入 `;` `|` `&` `$` `` ` `` 等 shell 元字符，仅允许字母、数字、点号和连字符，并考虑以非特权用户运行 Web 服务以限制命令执行影响范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0419.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0420.html","http://www.kootenayweb.bc.ca/scripts/whois.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1883","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5438","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20370","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0941.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0941.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0941","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0941.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0941.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/abb3d9c240bc75ee9d5885882897d780d10d15cb/2000/CVE-2000-0941.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0941.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0941.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0941.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2000-0941.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0687.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0685","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0685.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0937","title":"Samba SWAT 登录失败日志缺失漏洞","description":"Samba 2.0.7 中的 Web 管理工具 SWAT（Samba Web Administration Tool）存在登录审计日志缺失漏洞。当攻击者使用正确的用户名但错误的密码进行登录尝试时，SWAT 不会记录该失败登录事件，导致管理员无法通过日志发现暴力破解攻击行为。远程攻击者可利用此漏洞对系统用户账户进行无限制的密码暴力猜解，而无需担心被日志审计系统发现，严重威胁系统账户安全。该漏洞影响 Samba 2.0.7 版本，攻击者只需能够访问 SWAT 的 Web 管理界面即可发起攻击，无需任何身份认证。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0937"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:48Z","remediation":"升级 Samba 至 2.0.8 或更高版本，该版本已修复 SWAT 登录失败日志记录缺失的问题。如无法立即升级，可在 SWAT 服务前端部署反向代理（如 nginx）并配置访问频率限制（如 limit_req_zone），同时将 SWAT 绑定到内网 IP 而非 0.0.0.0，限制仅受信任 IP 可访问，以降低暴力破解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0430.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1873","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5442","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20340","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0937.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0937.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0937","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0937.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0937.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0937.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/83e06f4dc8d4c981660063007f8931d97353357a/2000/CVE-2000-0937.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0937.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0937.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0937.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0685.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0685.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0685.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0684","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0684.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0936","title":"Samba SWAT 日志文件权限信息泄露漏洞","description":"Samba 2.0.7 中的 Web 管理工具 SWAT（Samba Web Administration Tool）在安装时将 cgi.log 日志文件设置为全局可读权限，导致本地攻击者可读取该日志文件中的敏感信息，如用户名称和密码。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证即可利用，影响 Samba 2.0.7 版本。由于日志文件权限配置不当，任何拥有本地系统访问权限的用户均可直接读取日志内容，造成敏感信息泄露。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0936"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:48Z","remediation":"升级 Samba 至 2.0.8 或更高版本（该版本修复了 SWAT cgi.log 权限问题）。如无法升级，手动执行 chmod 600 /usr/local/samba/var/cgi.log 限制日志文件权限为仅 root 可读写；在 smb.conf 中禁用 SWAT（设置 disable_swat = yes）；或通过 Web 服务器配置限制 SWAT 访问来源 IP。如不使用 SWAT 管理功能，建议彻底移除 swat 二进制文件及对应 CGI 脚本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0430.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1874","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5445","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20341","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2000/CVE-2000-0936.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0936.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-0936.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0936.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0936","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/a98b678de864d822449fa563f0932aa46fad56c0/CVEs/2000/CVE-2000-0936.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0936.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0936.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0936.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-0936.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0684.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0684.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0682","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0682.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0935","title":"Samba SWAT 符号链接漏洞","description":"Samba 2.0.7 的 Web 管理工具 SWAT（Samba Web Administration Tool）存在符号链接漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在 cgi.log 日志文件上创建符号链接，诱使 SWAT 以 root 权限写入日志，从而覆盖系统任意文件，实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 Samba 2.0.7 版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低，可导致完全控制目标系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0935"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:48Z","remediation":"升级 Samba 至 2.0.8 或更高版本，该版本修复了 SWAT 写入 cgi.log 时跟随符号链接的问题。如无法升级，可删除 SWAT 的 setuid 权限（chmod -s /usr/sbin/swat），并通过 hosts allow 限制 SWAT 仅允许本地回环地址访问（在 smb.conf 的 [swat] 段中添加 hosts allow = 127.0.0.1）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0430.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1872","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5443","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20339","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2000/CVE-2000-0935.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0935.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-0935.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0935.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0935","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/a98b678de864d822449fa563f0932aa46fad56c0/CVEs/2000/CVE-2000-0935.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0935.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0935.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0935.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0935.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0682.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0682.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0682.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0681","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0681.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0930","title":"David Harris Pegasus Mail 3.12 文件转发漏洞","description":"Pegasus Mail 3.12 存在任意文件读取漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送包含特制 mailto: 协议 URL 的邮件，并在 URL 中添加 -F 开关参数，诱使用户点击该链接后即可读取目标系统上的任意文件。该漏洞影响 Pegasus Mail 3.12 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，危害中等。由于该漏洞可导致敏感信息泄露，建议用户升级至更高版本或禁用 mailto: 协议处理中的 -F 参数。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0930"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:47Z","remediation":"升级 Pegasus Mail 至 3.12a 或更高版本，该版本已修复 mailto: 协议 -F 参数允许读取任意文件的问题。如无法升级，可在浏览器中禁用 mailto: 协议处理程序，或配置防火墙/代理服务器过滤包含 mailto: -F 的恶意请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0039.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0436.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1738","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5326","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20249","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0930.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0930.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0930","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0930.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0930.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/cb4fa88be1e2cec066471c94ef8377b081c79cb6/2000/CVE-2000-0930.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0930.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0930.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0930.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0930.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0681.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0681.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0681.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0680","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0680.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0929","title":"Microsoft Windows Media Player 7 OCX 控件拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows Media Player 7 的 OCX 控件存在资源释放不当漏洞，当 RTF 格式邮件中嵌入特制的 OCX 控件且未正确关闭时，可导致目标系统发生拒绝服务。攻击者可通过向受害者发送包含恶意 OCX 控件的 RTF 邮件触发该漏洞，无需用户交互即可利用。该漏洞影响 Windows Media Player 7 及支持 OCX 控件的邮件客户端，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0929"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:47Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-068 提供的补丁，下载地址为 https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=69EDE8CE-86E7-4CCB-ABAC-2A1CF1C46406。该补丁修改了 Windows Media Player 7 的 OCX 控件在关闭嵌入 OCX 的 RTF 邮件时的行为。如无法安装补丁，可暂时卸载 Windows Media Player 7，或在邮件客户端中禁用 RTF 格式邮件预览，将 Outlook/Outlook Express 设置为以纯文本方式阅读邮件。","statu