chnology CyberOffice Shopping Cart 2.0 价格修改漏洞","description":"SmartWin CyberOffice Shopping Cart 2（又名 CyberShop）存在价格修改漏洞。远程攻击者可通过拦截并修改订单提交请求中的 \"Price\" 隐藏表单变量值，以任意价格完成商品购买。该漏洞源于服务端未对用户提交的价格参数进行有效性校验，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，可能导致商家遭受经济损失。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0926"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:46Z","remediation":"建议立即在服务端对商品价格进行二次校验，禁止信任客户端提交的隐藏表单字段值，所有价格计算必须在服务端会话中完成。如无法修改代码，建议迁移至受支持的电商平台（如 WooCommerce、Magento），并对购物车提交数据实施 HMAC 签名验证防止篡改。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/win2ksecadvice/2000-q4/0000.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97050627707128&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1733","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5319","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20247","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0926.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0926.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0926","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0926.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0926.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/124ab3e5e42be0a51c386ce59b3e73127df55887/2000/CVE-2000-0926.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0926.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0926.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0926.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5